# ChefBar GTK / CSS

- GTK 3.24 via `gtk 0.18`. No GTK4, no relm4, no webview, no Electron.
- Panel geometry is fixed 860×880, `set_resizable(false)`, undecorated, `keep_above`, centered (`src/panel/mod.rs`).
- Three surfaces, one snapshot: tray · palette overlay · panel. Overlay reuses `palette.rs` ranking. No second search pipeline.
- CSS is a GTK3 subset generated from Rust tokens in `src/css.rs`. Forbidden in emitted CSS: custom properties (`--*`), `gap`, `inset`, `grid-gap`, `place-items`, gradients, `box-shadow` glow, `filter`.
- Tokens: dark canvas `#121111`, light `#F7F6F5`, accent `#317CFF` / `#5C97FF`, radius 6/10/200, hairlines, General Sans + IBM Plex Mono. Green is reserved for git/PR/consent; amber = wait-on-you.
- Motion: fades 120 ms (`PANEL_MS`) only for open/close/drawer. No animation during poll-render.
- Density is a padding-token swap (`comfortable` / `compact`), not two layouts.
- UI thread does not call `http::Client`. Refresh reads `Shared` and rebuilds widgets from data.
